{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0446_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0446_story_07_title", "source_sha256": "cae884e60526e606e35104e36bf686a2aa34b6ec52d48762e88802d9ef3583f3", "ja": "二人のメモリーズ", "zh": "两人的回忆", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0446_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0446_story_07_synopsis", "source_sha256": "de12b28c28a4f43913b9e840fa88fc048b3b85d010c8f7129470b75867b5d151", "ja": "温泉旅行にやってきた風花と貴音は\n『秘密のメモリーズ』の最終回について\n語り合い、より仲を深めていくのだった。\n一方、最終回を視聴した小鳥は、演者に\n昂る感情をぶつけようと待ち構えていた。", "zh": "来到温泉旅行的风花和贵音\n聊起了《秘密的回忆》的大结局，\n两人的关系也因此更加亲密。\n另一方面，看完大结局的小鸟正守在那里，\n准备将激昂的情感倾泻向演员们。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0446_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0446_story_07_1000_041fuk", "source_sha256": "bb5287bdd8c4172450de641b7b613fb555c1b4526b2e1fa812da1e5c3560a046", "ja": "はぁ～……。\n温泉、気持ち良かったぁ……♪", "zh": "哈啊～……温泉泡得真舒服啊……♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0446_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0446_story_07_1001_008tak", "source_sha256": "afa803d396fd687c135327c21872e324b3e631d8697de8be314bb7cadaeaf24c", "ja": "真、いいお湯でしたね。\n心の中までほぐれていくようでした。", "zh": "真，温泉水真好呢。\n感觉连内心都舒展开来了。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0446_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0446_story_07_1002_041fuk", "source_sha256": "69d207198d91a7c6318b3aa58f7d84890c811505bdb305684868acabce16f738", "ja": "旅館につくなり温泉に駆け込んで大正解だったね♪\nペアの相手に誘ってくれてありがとう～。", "zh": "一到旅馆就跑去泡温泉，真是太正确了呢♪  \n谢谢你邀请我当搭档～", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0446_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0446_story_07_1003_008tak", "source_sha256": "34c32d63924dddcb6fd4f3c392f886dc4935a7fd2f39344601bb1093636b79ec", "ja": "夕貴乃の相手は、帆風に決まっています。\nそれに……私もぜひ、風花と来たかったのです。", "zh": "夕贵乃的搭档，自然非帆风莫属。\n况且……我也非常希望能和风花一起来。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0446_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0446_story_07_1004_008tak", "source_sha256": "95a48f33c06a7dd634b5849bbc17d492e8bd5895587b010c29c1ebc290b69fcb", "ja": "こうして風花と二人になれる機会は……\n今のうちだけかもしれませんから。", "zh": "像这样能和风花独处的机会……说不定只有现在了。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0446_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0446_story_07_1005_041fuk", "source_sha256": "3c67a9b0a0f844e9b8437224fb0739acd9d4347472d994baddcf9d6064488dff", "ja": "ふふっ、うれしい。\nありがとう、貴音ちゃん……。", "zh": "呵呵，好开心。\n谢谢你，贵音……。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0446_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0446_story_07_1006_041fuk", "source_sha256": "4120c9fd5063ddb157d84c4897b3144688e2e6dc6fbadbe74f11a9278a134a2d", "ja": "それでね。えっと……。", "zh": "所以呢。那个……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0446_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0446_story_07_1007_008tak", "source_sha256": "cb45c296be3cac316db2f4cbd6d9dc170113f4deb5da26f35796d4266ac2c747", "ja": "はい。なんでしょう？", "zh": "好的。请问是什么事？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0446_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0446_story_07_1008_041fuk", "source_sha256": "85d7456a7d3420e9bab7965fa6bc642ff20cee743abf764e28a7067eeb450640", "ja": "あのね……。うーん……。\nやっぱり、なんでもない！", "zh": "那个……嗯……\n还是算了，没什么！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0446_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0446_story_07_1009_008tak", "source_sha256": "cf1d0886a4c93ca72174a0cb23d4da178d63567339e1790b8d8074e3a05a5d10", "ja": "なんと……いけずな風花ですね。\n言いかけたことは、きちんと教えてください。", "zh": "真是的……风花还真坏心眼呢。\n刚才欲言又止的话，请好好告诉我。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0446_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0446_story_07_1010_041fuk", "source_sha256": "602715df45b3b1a5f94c33f854310f46b360a0da192197d051bc1e55f13e5735", "ja": "う～ん……じゃあ、言っちゃうね。", "zh": "嗯……那我就说出来啦。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0446_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0446_story_07_1011_041fuk", "source_sha256": "96e68e3bb902777ec822524bafa4cff6ed5522fe15c500b8ca06a93c0c8504e7", "ja": "『秘密のメモリーズ』の最終回。\n帆風の気持ちには、びっくりしちゃったけど……。", "zh": "《秘密的回忆》的最后一集。  \n虽然对帆风的心情感到很惊讶……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0446_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0446_story_07_1012_041fuk", "source_sha256": "a7260ff917e4653182442fce22210b06b5110915441d7750ab931c5ded8e165c", "ja": "でも、違和感はなかったの。撮影中ずっと\n帆風として過ごしてきて、すごく納得できた。", "zh": "不过，我并没有觉得不对劲。拍摄期间一直以帆风的身份度过，所以非常能够理解。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0446_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0446_story_07_1013_008tak", "source_sha256": "1a6ea658c56014287f71571998291820436fefd6595377c48efa9e0f23faaa2b", "ja": "はい。私も、あの結末には……\n心の霧が晴れていく思いがいたしました。", "zh": "是的。我也觉得，看到那个结局……心中的迷雾仿佛渐渐散去了。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0446_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0446_story_07_1014_041fuk", "source_sha256": "1538ba9ea50e02faa4d54652ddec54560ad260d00f876f7d1778065246c7aa97", "ja": "もちろん私たちは、帆風本人でも、夕貴乃本人でも\nないけど……まだ自分の中に帆風がいるから。", "zh": "我们当然不是帆风本人，也不是夕贵乃本人……但帆风还存在于我们心中。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0446_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0446_story_07_1015_041fuk", "source_sha256": "44c3d45c3c9deaf6cdd2ec4288339a7adba7f82c0af2fbcc5bae2955bf6f3272", "ja": "だから、夕貴乃とこうして一緒に旅ができるのが、\nすごくかけがえなくて……大切に思えるなぁ、って。", "zh": "所以，能像这样和夕贵乃一起旅行，对我来说真的无可替代……让我觉得非常珍贵。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0446_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0446_story_07_1016_008tak", "source_sha256": "d3a1189381a6046b9fc6cbe24773409ef559ad0db4a87287b8be40f51dfbff85", "ja": "それは……私も同じです。", "zh": "那是……我也是一样的。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0446_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0446_story_07_1017_041fuk", "source_sha256": "1cb2bfe0f8905216cfe62ef7840b17e249e5381141b729b2cbbbdcd88de2b4b5", "ja": "えっ……、貴音ちゃんが？", "zh": "咦……贵音也是？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0446_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0446_story_07_1018_008tak", "source_sha256": "ee18068c7f3d619782fd06b706cda95dc424cd1d8f36cc71b8b06b6429a82609", "ja": "はい。おそらく夕貴乃も、ずっと前から、\n帆風の想いには気づいていたはずですから。", "zh": "是的。夕贵乃恐怕从很久以前，就已经察觉到帆风的心意了。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0446_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0446_story_07_1019_041fuk", "source_sha256": "1657a00c52a0dab54a765f2886a5abf83fe84c8dd2c896fb7a318b410839251f", "ja": "……、そう、なの？", "zh": "……是，这样吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0446_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0446_story_07_1020_008tak", "source_sha256": "3b8ad7a876586538dea251478ac426502be2193f02ca541f381fb29577a23818", "ja": "少なくとも、私の中に残る夕貴乃は……\nそういっています。", "zh": "至少，留在我心中的夕贵乃……\n是这么说的。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0446_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0446_story_07_1021_041fuk", "source_sha256": "1bd6ca0598f222f98313eb600762c7d43fdfca06c5fb29204c75592f93532aea", "ja": "そっか……。\n帆風としては、すっごく嬉しいかな♪", "zh": "这样啊……\n作为帆风，我真的特别开心♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0446_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0446_story_07_1022_008tak", "source_sha256": "8ef290658540af69672baa1829dcf4fcbfca7541566044696307d870187aae7e", "ja": "ドラマでは、夕貴乃の返事までは\n描かれていませんでしたが……。", "zh": "电视剧中并没有描写夕贵乃的回应……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0446_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0446_story_07_1023_008tak", "source_sha256": "3a2e01474cbf6b7af857c0b1b8b2434583443d524ac5b63f4cc4b7cc706f53af", "ja": "夕貴乃もまた、帰るべきところに帰ることでしょう。", "zh": "夕贵乃也一定会回到她该回的地方去吧。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0446_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0446_story_07_1024_041fuk", "source_sha256": "3c5be8cdc43624efd0e61663307bea3b87f8037a658a14dc6710bf18d3f47708", "ja": "そうだね。私達が{$P$}さんの\nところに。劇場に、帰るみたいに♪", "zh": "是啊。我们也要回到{$P$}先生那里去。就像回到剧场一样♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0446_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0446_story_07_1025_se", "source_sha256": "48cbffd51a01155bb4f38218a4267b3d2f11b020ca0284601a2c8817b010b1dd", "ja": "ガチャ。", "zh": "抽卡。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0446_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0446_story_07_1026_p", "source_sha256": "094da8c43d99ee9f8b0175c0a084e63495628a56f52c99433a636874485b996e", "ja": "おはようございま……はっくしゅん！", "zh": "早上好……阿嚏！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0446_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0446_story_07_1027_101kot", "source_sha256": "fbbf224f6e5a5e374965763862e53a1ea6883ddbd353f670c819fb6a6f80eea5", "ja": "{$P$}さん、風邪ですか？　最近は\n寒暖の差が激しいですから、気を付けてくださいね。", "zh": "{$P$}先生，是感冒了吗？最近\n温差很大，要多加小心哦。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0446_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0446_story_07_1028_p", "source_sha256": "fe5027b085c2b9d3860e6432f0c0db44506b87a9aa311d32b53bec58ee384277", "ja": "ありがとうございます。\n……あ、『秘密のメモリーズ』を見てたんですね。", "zh": "谢谢你。\n……啊，你刚才在看《秘密的Memories》啊。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0446_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0446_story_07_1029_041fuk", "source_sha256": "46fe066e64a510f2c9aeeee4c3f3d1e9a10d34e78e88d3c2d6df8fcd750520a1", "ja": "「あれ……ごめんね。泣くつもりじゃなかったの。\nなんで、こんな……」", "zh": "“咦……对不起。我没打算哭的。\n为什么会这样……”", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0446_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0446_story_07_1030_008tak", "source_sha256": "35fb9a84defbc2387299c309f302e19e4a587ace75c29a4902b0d6f067fe4faa", "ja": "「帆風……」", "zh": "“帆风……”", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0446_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0446_story_07_1031_041fuk", "source_sha256": "5e93948eaab040be775d28ece3f65f6c0bb9fa68f78a8ccf818671e4f95e8b48", "ja": "「一生泣かないで、ずっとこのままでって……\n思ってたけど……。思ってたけど……」", "zh": "「我本来觉得……\n要是能一辈子都不哭，一直像这样下去就好了……但我虽然这么想过……」", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0446_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0446_story_07_1032_008tak", "source_sha256": "1db5831f00e59e031e554e568f9475f05b21412c317eedd06c7f232cc065ecca", "ja": "「うん……」", "zh": "嗯……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0446_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0446_story_07_1033_041fuk", "source_sha256": "6f8e3711ea3a744e805cd9a08789f94405012a41b86c519636b85b87ebf33178", "ja": "「あのね。……好きだよ」", "zh": "那个……我喜欢你。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0446_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0446_story_07_1034_p", "source_sha256": "b8921621b32ca2ad6aed8fdb05fd760808a96c7179abe2e1ed8b4b9aaf0e6590", "ja": "最終回は昨日放送でしたよね。\n録画ですか？", "zh": "最终回是昨天播出的吧。\n是录播吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0446_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0446_story_07_1035_101kot", "source_sha256": "25e61e37ebd8fb4a204517be898d1e202ad25158f00f28437d9117f6978258d0", "ja": "放送直後に、サブスク配信が始まったんです。\nもう私、10回は観ちゃいました♪", "zh": "刚播完流媒体平台就上线了。\n我已经看了足足10遍呢♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0446_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0446_story_07_1036_p", "source_sha256": "e480593a4582f6ec00aff94d1cc21b7e94b6e90953557112f65a0e322cf16d8b", "ja": "そんなにですか！？", "zh": "有那么多吗！？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0446_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0446_story_07_1037_101kot", "source_sha256": "656cf0028b30a789be2621cb56d9786014be7b243cc114c4fb13fe81611933f6", "ja": "そんなにです！\n昨日の最終回、すごかったじゃないですか！", "zh": "有那么夸张吗！\n昨天的大结局不是很精彩嘛！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0446_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0446_story_07_1038_101kot", "source_sha256": "8137cc4f7e9fb1f544f504b4f72cad03b2dc001c7ac158b0b230e90a368d1f30", "ja": "SNSでもトレンド独占してましたし、私も思わず\n長文の怪文書を投稿してしまいました！", "zh": "社交媒体上也直接霸占了趋势榜，连我也忍不住\n发了篇长篇怪文呢！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0446_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0446_story_07_1039_p", "source_sha256": "eb516ea7bdab0002e3cbc24339b856bef04e84ab3ed879799dffb0069820ab92", "ja": "は、はあ……。そんなに熱中して\n観ていただけたとは、ありがとうございます。", "zh": "啊、啊……您能看得那么投入，真是太感谢了。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0446_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0446_story_07_1040_101kot", "source_sha256": "7b6e4257213e2584321b24419d2f84fab321d4098d082f22be9382b0bf926649", "ja": "いえ！　お礼を言うべきは、素晴らしいドラマを\n観せてもらった私のほうです♪", "zh": "不！应该道谢的是我才对，感谢让我看到了这么精彩的电视剧♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0446_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0446_story_07_1041_101kot", "source_sha256": "7454383120bce8548d316c1466bfff1016ed9759457f39f000870bb73ace7f41", "ja": "今、風花さんと貴音ちゃんは温泉旅行中でしたよね。\nああ……早くこの想いを直接伝えたい……っ！", "zh": "现在风花小姐和贵音正在温泉旅行，对吧。  \n啊啊……真想早点当面把这份心意传达给她们……！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0446_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0446_story_07_1042_p", "source_sha256": "8b25770946ec679ccfd9c5058011210c70cc99d402ffde68a1c9ea12eb0eca5e", "ja": "そ、そうですか。あくまで役の上での話ですからね？\n……まぁ、二人ともすごく喜ぶと思いますけど！", "zh": "是、是这样啊。毕竟只是角色上的设定，对吧？\n……不过，我想她们两个都会非常高兴的！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
